# Everything in this repository is LF on disk, but Windows git defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite every text file on the next checkout
# and hand the next person a diff covering the whole project before they had
# changed anything. Pin it so the working copy matches what is committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The .toc is read by the game's own parser. Several addon packagers have been
# fussy about stray carriage returns in it, so it is never worth finding out.
*.toc text eol=lf
*.lua text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf

# Listing images are compared byte for byte against what tools/ regenerates.
# Any newline translation at all would break that check.
*.png binary

# The textures the addon ships are binary, and the game reads them byte for
# byte; tools/make-icon.py and tools/make-glow.py regenerate them exactly.
*.tga binary
